sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User (TUI / API)
  participant E as WorkflowEngine
  participant P as CommandProcessor
  participant C as CompleteWorkItemCommand
  participant D as Decorators (front)
  participant W as WorkItem (+State)
  participant M as InstanceCoordinator
  participant X as Expression (guard)
  participant A as WorkAssigner
  participant O as Observers
  U->>E: completeWorkItem(instance, "Review claim and decide", "WRITE_OFF")
  E->>E: isInProgress? actor is assignee?
  E->>P: run(CompleteWorkItemCommand)
  P->>C: execute()
  C->>D: complete("WRITE_OFF")
  D->>W: complete("WRITE_OFF") (validation / security / audit first)
  W->>M: notify(COMPLETED)
  M->>M: mark completed, release dependants
  loop each item whose prerequisites are resolved
    M->>X: evaluate(outcome('Review claim and decide') == REPAIR)
    X-->>M: false
    M->>W: skip("branch not taken") -> SkippedState
    M->>O: SKIPPED event (audit)
    M->>M: dead-path: dependants with only skipped prerequisites are skipped
  end
  M->>A: assign(next item, pool) [Strategy]
  A-->>M: participant
  M->>O: ASSIGNED / ROUTED events
  P-->>E: true
  E-->>U: OK + new events
